class Solution(object):
    def findDisappearedNumbers(self, nums):
        """
        :type nums: List[int]
        :rtype: List[int]
        """
        for num in nums:
            idx=(abs(num)-1)
            if nums[idx]>0:
                nums[idx]=-nums[idx]

        ans=[]
        for i in range(len(nums)):
            if nums[i]>0:
               ans.append(i+1)
        return ans

Time Complexity: (O(n))
Space Complexity:(O(1))
In-place marking using negative numbers
